Z||000004||Sillhouette.com||06-15-2000||11:29 PM||||Hey Shannonville!<P>That place brings back memories.  We hosted two racing events including GT 1 and GT 2 races among other for the last couple of years.  The club is called TLMC and mostly SOLO racing is our thing.  In anyevent I'll have to see since I arrive back to Toronto on July the 15 and have to see if Jetlag will be a problem in those turns.  It's a bit too early to tell.  What is the deadline or we just show up poni up the doe and go?<P><BR>Thanks for the invitation.<P>Later||||reg||1
